# el-i4-dohc-cam-switch: 3 s holds at throttle 0, with 0.5 s sweeps between them.
hold 950 0 3
sweep 950 2000 0 0.5
hold 2000 0 3
sweep 2000 3000 0 0.5
hold 3000 0 3
sweep 3000 4000 0 0.5
hold 4000 0 3
sweep 4000 5000 0 0.5
hold 5000 0 3
sweep 5000 6000 0 0.5
hold 6000 0 3
sweep 6000 7000 0 0.5
hold 7000 0 3
sweep 7000 8000 0 0.5
hold 8000 0 3
sweep 8000 8600 0 0.5
hold 8600 0 3
